# Bootloader + firmware binaries fetched by `tools/fetch-vendor.sh`.
# Not committed: keeps repo size down + sidesteps redistribution
# license-tracking. Run the fetch script (or `xtask vendor`) to
# populate.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
# busybox vendored binaries: x86_64 already tracked; aarch64 added
# per F148 once the cross-toolchain landed.
!busybox/
!busybox/build.sh
!busybox/busybox
!busybox/busybox-aarch64
busybox/busybox-1.37.0/
# vendor/cross: README tracked, toolchain blobs ignored (~370 MB).
!cross/
!cross/README.md
cross/aarch64-linux-musl-cross/
# dhcpcd 10.3.2: per-arch static-musl binaries + build recipe tracked;
# source tree + tarball regenerated by tools/fetch-dhcpcd.sh.
!dhcpcd/
!dhcpcd/build.sh
!dhcpcd/dhcpcd-x86_64
!dhcpcd/dhcpcd-aarch64
# dropbear 2024.86: per-arch static-musl binaries + build recipe;
# source tree + tarball regenerated by tools/fetch-dropbear.sh.
!dropbear/
!dropbear/build.sh
!dropbear/dropbearmulti-x86_64
!dropbear/dropbearmulti-aarch64
